From 62393e2c9fae0d7063c0c0376d14061a4a1e2038 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 06:34:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace placeholder imagery with real project and founder
 photography

- Add ProjectPhoto component (real optimized images, same ratio/kenburns/
  hover-zoom API as the placeholder it replaces)
- Homepage: real hero photo and 6 real project photos in the portfolio mosaic
- About page: real founder portrait with name/title caption
- Service detail pages: real project photo in the full-bleed header band,
  cycled per service
- Remove now-unused PlaceholderImage component
